  "content": "<h3><em><strong>巴西制造</strong> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b4c5f477e1655471df04174516f88081286146a7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></em></h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/665f041a8a2b95b22f8a57282e1e36f1543ee9a0_0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1706\" height=\"700\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/RE6JVPMFpV\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/88ded17ec723eff80f6785bbeda38e3c47584c48.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dYE3TNTVNFFKXL%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dBy%2bbeing%2ba%2bdonor%252c%2byou%2bcontribute%2bto%2bthe%2bcreation%2bof%2bmy%2bMinecraft%2bcontent.%2526currency_code%253dBRL\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab71d7575902b145c54f6027017d09930124d1d7.png\" alt=\"Pay pal donate\" width=\"\" height=\"\"> </a></p><h2><strong>关于</strong></h2><p>扑翼滑翔机是一款定制滑翔机模组，为飞行带来全新体验。灵感源自达芬奇的飞行器，这套精心制作的翅膀装备让你能够以自定义动画、音效，并全面支持Curios后背槽，在空中翱翔。</p><p>无论你是在广袤地形中探索，还是冲入危险地带，扑翼机都能让每一次飞行都充满史诗感。</p><h2><strong>预览</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media2.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExcXppMHAxMW05MjdpeHVmZDR4cG55MXB4ZDhpdDNlMGZvc3psOWcxOCZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/7Mt4GmaLtJyyVpbXl5/giphy.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"386\" height=\"218\"></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:559px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EBTCV4SWYAk?start=718&amp;hl=en&amp;cc_lang_pref=en&amp;cc_load_policy=1\" width=\"559\" height=\"325\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><h2><strong>如何使用</strong></h2><p>按下指定按键（默认为空格键）可以充能一条能量条并“扇动翅膀”以获得冲刺加速。该加速有2秒冷却时间。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e28a2ff0805e5bbdde15efadf76b908719d1c7b8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"169\"></p><h2><strong>合成</strong></h2><p>扑翼滑翔机只能使用Create模组中的机械合成台制作。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e702784c480242452853f53948adad2835e62d8c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"129\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a64f4dbb1c0a39aa4cca3c98f643b04f491f6f14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"301\"></p><h2><strong>必要依赖</strong></h2><p>本模组需要其他模组才能正常运行。请确保已安装以下模组以获得完整功能：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">⚙️ 机械动力 (Create)</a></li>\n</ul><h2><strong>可选依赖</strong></h2><p>以下模组可完全兼容：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">✨ Curios API</a> 或 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🎩 Accessories</a> + <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accessories-cc-layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios 兼容层</a>)</li>\n</ul><h2><strong>推荐搭配</strong></h2><p>该模组与以下模组配合使用效果更佳：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/distant-horizons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🌍 遥远视界 (Distant Horizons)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/do-a-barrel-roll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🛢️ 翻滚特技 (Do a Barrel Roll)</a></li>\n</ul>",
